<Slide style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', padding: '0px', position: 'relative', width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    {/* 顶部装饰线 */}
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 6, background: '#3D7BD9' }} />

    {/* 中央内容 */}
    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0,
        width: 1280, height: 720,
        justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center',
        flexDirection: 'column', padding: '0 120px', gap: 0,
    }}>
        <Text style={{
            fontSize: 44, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold',
            textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5, letterSpacing: 2,
        }}>
            「让每一句重要的话，都不被淹没」
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 90, height: 3, background: '#3D7BD9', marginTop: 40, marginBottom: 40 }} />

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 48, marginBottom: 48 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <FAIcon name='plus' style={{ fill: '#3D7BD9', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', opacity: 0.85 }}>接入更多平台</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <FAIcon name='sliders-h' style={{ fill: '#3D7BD9', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', opacity: 0.85 }}>自定义监控策略</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <FAIcon name='chart-line' style={{ fill: '#3D7BD9', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', opacity: 0.85 }}>周报与趋势分析</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <FAIcon name='search' style={{ fill: '#3D7BD9', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', opacity: 0.85 }}>文件库智能问答</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#B8CCF0', textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
            展望：从班级群聊监控，走向校园信息智能管理的完整平台
        </Text>
    </Box>

    {/* 左下角标 */}
    <Text style={{
        position: 'absolute', left: 60, bottom: 40,
        fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8',
    }}>
        聊天智能分析助手 · ChatMonitor
    </Text>
    {/* 右下页码 */}
    <Text style={{
        position: 'absolute', right: 60, bottom: 40,
        fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8',
    }}>
        14 / 14
    </Text>
</Slide>
